From ac628fe2abae4d244e64484e4fa47b953126e2fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:53:06 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: icon pack choice in App icons

An "Icon pack" row in the App icons sheet (shape tab, below themed
icons) chooses the system-wide icon pack: Settings.Secure
plait_icon_pack, which Launcher3 follows (home screen, app drawer,
recents, app open animations) and the framework uses for the icons
other apps load. Packs are found by the actions launchers use for icon
packs (ADW, Nova, Apex, GO, ...), with "System icons" to turn it off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
